## Ontology (Key Entities)
| Entity | Type | Fields | Relationships |
|---|---|---|---|
| Target (T) | core | sha, tree | pins Accounting, Subject, BackfillItem |
| CoveredLine | core | target, path, blob, interval, provenance, covered_by | derived from verified reviewed scope and conservative lineage mapping |
| ReviewRecord | core | schema, event_type, id, source_key, occurred_at, payload | immutable ledger event; only verified completed review scope grants credit |
| ReviewLedger | core | branch `cq/review-ledger`, ruleset, append validator | coverage authority; coverage index caches it, operational journals remain durable |
| CreditSource | supporting | crq-run, github-review, import | populates ReviewRecord.source |
| ImportanceTier | supporting | T1–T4, path globs (`policy/review-tiers.json`) | weights Candidate |
| Candidate | core | tier, score, paths or PRs | selected from uncovered CoveredLines; Tier A comes from the RequiredList |
| RequiredList | external | cr-backfill-order.md rows | seeds Tier A candidates |
| ReviewSubject | core | kind (pr-current, path-projection), base, head, paths and dispositions | built from Candidate at T |
| BackfillItem | core | rank 4, subject/job/attempt IDs, retry family, pin T, generation, state | durable job with separately reconciled vendor/publication ownership |
| Finding | supporting | occurrence ID, canonical ID, anchor, severity, triage/disposition event chain | durable delivery to repair inbox after current-tip confirmation |

